DTSTAMP:20261128T140412Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261202T130000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261202T180000
SUMMARY:AI-Roundtable — Souveräne KI in Verwaltung und Unternehmen
LOCATION:BFH Departement Wirtschaft\, Raum H051\, Brückenstrasse 73\, Bern
DESCRIPTION:Half-day working roundtable at the Bern University of Applied S
 ciences on sovereign AI in public administration and business\, including 
 a six-dimension evaluation framework for AI agent harnesses\, change manag
 ement and breakout groups\, capped at around 50 places.\n\nOrganiser: Zent
 rum für Schweizerische Digitale Souveränität (Zentrum SDS) at BFH\n\nDe
 tails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/zentrum-sds-ai-r
 oundtable-bern-2026/
